{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","questions":[{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q01","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ba35ed2133eb5fcf554a00df7e7e849ee72900811f5e8f26cbbf24f2cddbce81","body":[{"type":"text","value":"第六代移动通信技术（6G）使用的电磁波，部分处于太赫兹（THz）波段。"},{"type":"math","value":"1THz=10^{12}Hz"},{"type":"text","value":"，单位THz对应的物理量是（   ）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"能量"}],[{"type":"text","value":"功率"}],[{"type":"text","value":"频率"}],[{"type":"text","value":"波长"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】根据题干给出的单位关系"},{"type":"math","value":"1THz=10^{12}Hz"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"Hz"},{"type":"text","value":"（赫兹）是频率的单位，因此 "},{"type":"math","value":"THz"},{"type":"text","value":"（太赫兹）是频率的倍数单位，对应物理量为频率。\n故选 C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q02","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b1004459dbaad63970df9e284bb4b89dccc41013ff4880c121e5d646afac6f2d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"下列问题中，图示物体可看成质点的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4e27d7ad80dd04645db5416abd77a2d05007b0f335f24a12c19f605a707ddaab.png","width":2791,"height":510,"width_mm":146.58,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q02-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"研究图甲中“四川舰”的航行路径"}],[{"type":"text","value":"研究图乙中“歼-35”战斗机的飞行姿态"}],[{"type":"text","value":"研究图丙中“神舟二十二号”载人飞船与空间站的对接方式"}],[{"type":"text","value":"研究图丁中“蛟龙号”潜水器完成任务出水后调整方位回舱过程"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．研究“四川舰”的航行路径时，“四川舰”的体积和形状可以忽略，故“四川舰”可以看成质点，故A正确；\nB．研究“歼-35”战斗机的飞行姿态时，“歼-35”战斗机的体积和形状不可以忽略，故“歼-35”战斗机不可以看成质点，故B错误；\nC．研究“神舟二十二号”载人飞船与空间站的对接方式时，“神舟二十二号”的体积和形状不可以忽略，故“神舟二十二号”不可以看成质点，故C错误；\nD．研究“蛟龙号”潜水器完成任务出水后调整方位回舱过程时，“蛟龙号”的体积和形状不可以忽略，故“蛟龙号”不可以看成质点，故D错误。\n故选A。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q03","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"eb8b818b3acb88d043785109216d898474b905bb4aec53fe2ffd1e5fb58a1e31","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，钢架雪车运动员在具有阻力的倾斜赛道上滑行，则（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/004e2f7e013255fb08a507f4e4066068c8ecca6e0bb4cd29d0ccb61707316a31.png","width":811,"height":520,"width_mm":48.15,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q03-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"运动员在转弯时加速度为0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"运动员和钢架雪车整体机械能守恒"}],[{"type":"text","value":"钢架雪车所受重力和赛道对钢架雪车的支持力是一对平衡力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"钢架雪车对赛道的压力与赛道对钢架雪车的支持力是一对作用力和反作用力"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．运动员在转弯时一定有向心加速度，加速度不可能为零，故A错误；\nB．倾斜赛道有阻力，阻力对运动员和钢架雪车做负功，运动员和钢架雪车整体机械能不守恒，故B错误；\nC．钢架雪车所受重力竖直向下，赛道对钢架雪车的支持力垂直赛道向上，不在同一条直线上，不是一对平衡力，故C错误；\nD．钢架雪车对赛道的压力与赛道对钢架雪车的支持力是一对作用力和反作用力，故D正确。\n故选D。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q04","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0c479e1b50539432cbbba779dbc4319fac7cfcfa050479a6ef09a48b65ba309d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"手机电容式触摸屏的核心部件可简化为平行板电容器。当手指靠近触摸屏时，电容器两极板和手指间的电场线分布如图所示。下列说法正确的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7d33176f20ef78481024a3780f4512875571faf4c52a3522fda2e3773b001027.png","width":1560,"height":1339,"width_mm":57.41,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q04-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A点的电场强度大于B点的电场强度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"将一电子从A点移到B点，电子的电势能增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"极板上表面C点的电势等于下表面D点的电势"}],[{"type":"text","value":"若电子在E点释放，仅受静电力作用将沿电场线ab运动"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．电场线越密的地方场强越大，电场线越疏的地方场强越小，由图可知，A点的电场强度小于B点的电场强度，故A错误；\nB．顺着电场线电势逐渐降低，由图可知A点电势低于B点电势，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=-e\\varphi"},{"type":"text","value":"可知将一电子从A点移到B点，电子的电势能减小，故B错误；\nC．同一金属极板上，达到静电平衡后，电势处处相等，则极板上表面C点的电势等于下表面D点的电势，故C正确；\nD．由于电场线ab是曲线，则若电子在E点释放，仅受静电力作用不可能沿电场线ab运动，故D错误。\n故选C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q05","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"49b91643511645e5ed75862b3dbfb9c6ad75f06f760d2de0cbb5fdb31fc3a790","body":[{"type":"text","value":"已知行星的平均密度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":"，靠近行星表面运行的卫星做圆周运动的周期为T。对于任何行星均为同一常量的是（   ）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"math","value":"\\rho T"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\rho T^{2}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\rho ^{2}T"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\rho ^{2}T^{3}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】根据万有引力定律和圆周运动规律，卫星在行星表面附近运行时，万有引力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"G\\frac{M}{R^{2}}=\\frac{4\\pi ^{2}R}{T^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n行星平均密度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho =\\frac{M}{\\frac{4}{3}\\pi R^{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho =\\frac{3\\pi}{GT^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA．"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho T=\\frac{3\\pi}{GT}"},{"type":"text","value":"，与 "},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" 有关，非常量，故A错误；\nB． "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho T^{2}=\\frac{3\\pi}{G}"},{"type":"text","value":"，为常量，故B正确；\nC．"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho ^{2}T=\\frac{9\\pi ^{2}}{G^{2}T^{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，与 "},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" 有关，非常量，故C错误；\nD．"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho ^{2}T^{3}=\\frac{9\\pi ^{2}}{G^{2}T}"},{"type":"text","value":"，与 "},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" 有关，非常量，故D错误。\n故选B。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q06","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"551c03f42645c3e144f8cc5396de7886a9691a9dd25f978470f251ba5af4f75e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，一盏重为G的艺术灯用细绳悬挂，左右两侧细绳与水平方向夹角分别为45°和60°，细绳拉力分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。A和B是左侧细绳两端点，C和D分别是天花板和灯上的点，CD与AB平行，则（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/84710c1a86fed7d15c147f38b5bd7898a20ecf1afdf6f0f72635716144413c61.png","width":1547,"height":794,"width_mm":58.21,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q06-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"大于"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"都小于G"}],[{"type":"text","value":"用细绳连接C和B后撤去AB绳，可使灯位置不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"用细绳连接C和D后撤去AB绳，可使灯位置不变"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】AB．对艺术灯受力分析，如图所示\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9a14190f557d3eadc51569a172e2ae4eb8a691c8cad6efca2b66f780201f1450.png","width":1547,"height":1511,"width_mm":57.15},{"type":"text","value":"\n将"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":"三力平移后，构成矢量三角形，如图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/35f234a029b370a14c7d9e0c7a6fe6b0d7d6dc7efa2d18738d41c44f83ee46d3.png","width":722,"height":971,"width_mm":28.57},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据矢量三角形可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}<F_{2}<G"},{"type":"text","value":"，故A错误，B正确；\nCD．用细绳连接C和B后撤去AB绳或用细绳连接C和D后撤去AB绳，如图所示\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b9ba6b9df30b099f166d66a70b02cb8859e93a4ded24b38f25ab08f912f380e8.png","width":1547,"height":1598,"width_mm":57.15},{"type":"text","value":"\n若艺术灯位置保持不变，则三力不能交汇一点，即无法保持平衡，故CD错误。\n故选B。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q07","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6f4a4e2381e781a8bb1e4ab50d384edb2b35792578c282d56e5377551fe34b6e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"下列说法正确的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/51973cef599e1ab15db8a63db1978d2ab54142e882e4287e7d472a19a863ff4f.png","width":4327,"height":1588,"width_mm":146.58,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q07-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"图甲中线框在图示时刻的电流沿顺时针方向（俯视）"}],[{"type":"text","value":"若图乙中储罐内不导电液体液面上升，LC电路振荡周期减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"图丙中单色光入射楔形透明膜时，频率越高，明暗条纹间距越大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"用图丁中扭秤探究电荷间相互作用力时，应使金属小球A与C带同种电荷"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．根据右手定则，图甲中线框在图示时刻的电流沿逆时针方向（俯视），A错误；\nB．若图乙中储罐内不导电液体液面上升，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"C=\\frac{\\varepsilon S}{4\\pi kd}"},{"type":"text","value":"，ε变大，则C变大，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi \\sqrt{LC}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知，LC电路振荡周期增大，B错误；\nC．图丙中单色光入射楔形透明膜时，频率越高，波长越小，从透明膜前后表面反射的光的路程差相差一个波长的相邻两明纹的距离减小，即明暗条纹间距越小，C错误；\nD．用图丁中扭秤探究电荷间相互作用力时，应使金属小球A与C带同种电荷，两球由于排斥而使A转动，D正确。\n故选D。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q08","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d6fd861172f6da4166c4e6a48993f497bccdfe2f63d09f2bf326abb848a53f4e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，一根带负电的塑料棒，长为l、横截面积为S、均匀分布有N个电子（电子电荷量为"},{"type":"math","value":"-e"},{"type":"text","value":"）。让棒垂直于匀强磁场B，以速度v沿轴向做匀速运动。下列说法正确的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/166d4aea9d462a0a4558240bd41593e87e308994d7f87d97f69171937cc52226.png","width":1480,"height":540,"width_mm":62.44,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q08-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"等效电流的方向与v方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"等效电流的大小"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{veN}{l}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"棒产生的感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E=Blv"}],[{"type":"text","value":"棒所受安培力的大小"},{"type":"math","value":"F=NeSvlB"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A. 塑料棒带负电，则等效电流的方向与v方向相反，A错误；    \nB. 等效电流的大小"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{q}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{v\\Delta t\\cdot \\frac{N}{l}e}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{veN}{l}"},{"type":"text","value":"，B正确；\nC. 棒中几乎没有自由电子，磁通量不发生变化，不产生感应电动势，C错误；\nD. 棒所受安培力的大小"},{"type":"math","value":"F=BIl=NevB"},{"type":"text","value":"，D错误。\n故选B。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q09","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"534883ac6134ded885b5c4792702b422fc77084178fbb1db2000861d88a7fbe4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在地质探测中，可利用横波传播速度的不同，探测岩石密度信息。选择岩石分界面上的一点为原点、垂直分界面方向为x轴，建立如图所示的坐标系。在坐标原点安装周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=1\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"、振幅"},{"type":"math","value":"A=2mm"},{"type":"text","value":"的人工振源。"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时振源从平衡位置（"},{"type":"math","value":"y=0"},{"type":"text","value":"）开始沿y轴正方向振动，同时向两侧传播简谐横波。"},{"type":"math","value":"t=3\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"时在岩石Ⅰ（"},{"type":"math","value":"x<0"},{"type":"text","value":"）中的波恰好到达"},{"type":"math","value":"x=-3m"},{"type":"text","value":"处，岩石Ⅱ（"},{"type":"math","value":"x>0"},{"type":"text","value":"）中的波速为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{Ⅱ}=3\\times 10^{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，则（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7c1b7a75651748d244d06cbf542b713ce653ce79fbad8233f782e98fb362baf1.png","width":3062,"height":695,"width_mm":128.59,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q09-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"岩石Ⅰ和岩石Ⅱ中两波波长之比为"},{"type":"math","value":"3:1"}],[{"type":"math","value":"t=1.5\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"x=-1m"},{"type":"text","value":"处质点的振动方向沿y轴正方向"}],[{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim 3\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"内，"},{"type":"math","value":"x=1.25m"},{"type":"text","value":"处质点经过的路程为21mm"}],[{"type":"text","value":"增大振源的振动周期，岩石Ⅱ中的波速将变小"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．岩石Ⅰ中，横波传播速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{Ⅰ}=\\frac{\\left\\lvert \\Delta x \\right\\rvert}{\\Delta t}=1\\times 10^{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n波长公式"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda =vT"},{"type":"text","value":"，两波周期相同，故波长比等于波速比"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\lambda _{I}}{\\lambda _{II}}=\\frac{v_{I}}{v_{II}}=\\frac{1\\times 10^{3}}{3\\times 10^{3}}=\\frac{1}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A错误；\nB．"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时振源从平衡位置（"},{"type":"math","value":"y=0"},{"type":"text","value":"）开始沿y轴正方向振动，波传到"},{"type":"math","value":"x=-1m"},{"type":"text","value":"的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{1m}{1\\times 10^{3}m/s}=1\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"t=1.5\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"x=-1m"},{"type":"text","value":"处质点的已经振动的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t=0.5\\times 10^{-3}s=\\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n振源起振方向为y轴正方向，经过半个周期后，质点振动方向为y轴负方向，B错误；\nC．波传到 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=1.25m"},{"type":"text","value":"的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=\\frac{1.25m}{3\\times 10^{3}m/s}=\\frac{5}{12}\\times 10^{-3}s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n该质点振动的总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t'=\\left( 3-\\frac{5}{12} \\right)\\times 10^{-3}s=\\frac{31}{12}\\times 10^{-3}s=\\frac{31}{12}T"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即2个全振动和剩余时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7}{12}T"},{"type":"text","value":"，质点从平衡位置（y=0）开始向y轴正方向振动，则该质点经过的路程为"},{"type":"math","value":"s=2.5\\times 4A+A\\left\\lvert \\sin \\left( 2\\pi \\times \\frac{1}{12} \\right) \\right\\rvert =21mm"},{"type":"text","value":"，C正确；\nD．机械波在介质中的传播速度由介质本身的性质（如密度、弹性模量）决定，与振源的周期、频率无关，故波速不变，D错误。\n故选C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q10","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","sou