{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n磁感应强度变化率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}=a\\frac{\\Delta I}{\\Delta t}=-\\frac{aI_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入自感电动势公式"},{"type":"math","value":"E=N\\frac{\\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A错误；\nB．线圈A的有效匝数是1，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"4t_{0}\\sim 6t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间段内，电流变化率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\Delta I}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{2I_{0}}{2t_{0}}=\\frac{I_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n线圈A的感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E=nS\\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{\\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，B错误；\nC．流过线圈A的电荷量"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\overline{I}\\Delta t=\\frac{\\overline{E}}{R}\\Delta t=\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi _{A}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\Phi _{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"是穿过线圈A的总磁通量变化量。在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"内，螺线管电流恒定，穿过线圈A的总磁通量不变通过线圈A的电荷量为0。\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}\\sim 2t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"内，电流从"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"变为0，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta I=0-I_{0}=-I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim 2t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"内，通过线圈A的电荷量"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi _{A}}{R}=\\frac{\\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，C错误；\nD．在 "},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim 5t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"内，线圈A产生焦耳热只有在电流变化的区间才产生感应电动势和焦耳热即 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}\\sim 3t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"4t_{0}\\sim 5t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"  时间段。"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}\\sim 3t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"时长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，线圈A的感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}=nS\\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{\\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n产生的焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=\\frac{E_{1}^{2}}{R}\\cdot 2t_{0}=2\\frac{\\left( \\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0} \\right)^{2}}{Rt_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在 "},{"type":"math","value":"4t_{0}\\sim 5t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间段内，感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2}=nS\\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{\\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0}}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n产生的焦耳热"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2}=\\frac{E_{2}^{2}}{R}t_{0}=\\frac{\\left( \\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0} \\right)^{2}}{Rt_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim 5t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"内，线圈A产生的焦耳热"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=Q_{1}+Q_{2}=3\\frac{\\left( \\pi r_{2}^{2}aI_{0} \\right)^{2}}{Rt_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，D正确。\n故选D。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q11","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"89bfc94f2e17d18a7709446512b5955d542828d779ece925c6efa216cdb7f9ba","body":[{"type":"text","value":"下列说法正确的是（   ）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"变化的电场会产生磁场"}],[{"type":"text","value":"汽车经过凹形路面最低点时处于超重状态"}],[{"type":"text","value":"相对论时空观认为运动物体的长度与速度无关"}],[{"type":"text","value":"秦山核电站通过提取海水中的氘和氚进行核反应获取能量"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AB","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．根据麦克斯韦电磁理论可知，变化的电场会产生磁场，故A正确；\nB．汽车经过凹形路面最低点时，根据牛顿第二定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"N-mg=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"N=mg+m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}>mg"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知此时汽车处于超重状态，故B正确；\nC．相对论时空观认为运动物体的长度与速度有关，物体的长度会随着物体的速度不同而改变，故C错误；\nD．通过提取海水中的氘和氚进行核反应属于轻核聚变，而秦山核电站利用重核裂变获取能量，故D错误。\n故选AB。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q12","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7e32cdc3be18c1885d36a1197862c397d51ac05c6d4a8b62ba82629d5d9d4fc5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图1所示，三块同质有机玻璃板甲、乙、丙，拼接形成两层同心圆弧空气膜。现让一束激光从P点射入，并在空气膜Q处注入一滴油，呈现图2所示的光路（其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"为相应光线的入射角）。已知空气折射率为1，光在空气中的传播速度为c。下列说法正确的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/00f0abf185898a8fe2a165fc3526263fc9751624f2964498887bc2c6fe89e00d.png","width":2512,"height":850,"width_mm":132.82,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q12-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"有机玻璃的折射率"},{"type":"math","value":"n\\ge \\frac{1}{\\sin \\beta}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"光在有机玻璃中的传播速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v\\ge csin\\alpha"}],[{"type":"text","value":"有机玻璃的折射率可能大于油的折射率"}],[{"type":"text","value":"若在R处注入同种油滴，光线不会从R处进入乙"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．光线在外层空气膜发生全反射，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\beta \\ge sinC=\\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即有机玻璃的折射率"},{"type":"math","value":"n\\ge \\frac{1}{\\sin \\beta}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A正确；\nB．光线在内层空气膜发生全反射，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\alpha \\ge sinC=\\frac{1}{n_{\\text{玻}\\text{璃}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{\\text{玻}\\text{璃}}=\\frac{c}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得光在有机玻璃中的传播速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v\\le csin\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"，B错误；\nCD．在空气膜Q处注入一滴油后，光线能通过油膜界面，不再发生全反射，则此时临界角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\alpha \\le sinC^{'}=\\frac{n_{\\text{油}}}{n_{\\text{玻}\\text{璃}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则此时有机玻璃的折射率可能大于油的折射率，若在R处注入同种油滴，光线同样可沿直线通过油膜界面，光线会从R处进入乙，C正确，D错误。\n故选AC。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q13","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"243fee2be2f3ded68f9d1442dd7e7f13cbc9aa71c3eddadc19075ad0f92f7669","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在充满液态氢的气泡室中存在方向垂直图示平面、磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场。一束"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"射线通过气泡室，其中一个"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子将一个氢原子打出一个电子（"},{"type":"math","value":"e^{-}"},{"type":"text","value":"），同时自身转变为一对正负电子对"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left( e^{+}-e^{-} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"。三个电子在气泡室中的径迹如图所示（氢原子和产生的质子均可视为静止），开始时，三条径迹共切于O点，其半径分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"。假设电子在气泡室中所受阻力大小正比于速率，比例系数为k，方向与速度方向相反。沿径迹1、2、3运动的电子速度减为0时的位置分别位于M（图中未标出）、P、Q三点。已知电子质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"，元电荷为e，光速为c。下列说法正确的是（   ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5f7153f32467cd9b04e244ab419abf1ca43ce631c17cefb77b2c022a48cb87c3.png","width":180,"height":200,"width_mm":41.54,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子的能量小于"},{"type":"math","value":"2m_{e}c^{2}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子的动量大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"eB\\left( r_{1}+r_{2}+r_{3} \\right)"}],[{"type":"text","value":"O与P、Q的距离之比"},{"type":"math","value":"OP:OQ=r_{2}:r_{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"沿径迹1运动的电子总路程为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{\\left( eB \\right)^{2}+k^{2}}}{k}r_{1}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．因"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子转化为一对正负电子对应的能量为"},{"type":"math","value":"2m_{e}c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，同时"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子将一部分能量传递给被打出的电子，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子的能量一定大于"},{"type":"math","value":"2m_{e}c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A错误；\nB．电子在磁场中做圆周运动，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"evB=m\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"p=mv=eBr"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则沿轨迹1、2、3运动的电子对应的动量分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=eBr_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=eBr_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3}=eBr_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由动量守恒可知"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\gamma}=p_{1}+p_{2}+p_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"光子的动量大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\gamma}=eB\\left( r_{1}+r_{2}+r_{3} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，B正确；\nC． 由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum Bqv_{y}\\Delta t-\\sum kv_{x}\\Delta t=0"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\sum Bqv_{x}\\Delta t-\\sum kv_{y}\\Delta t=0-mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}=\\frac{mv_{0}}{\\sqrt{B^{2}y^{2}+k^{2}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nO与P、Q的距离之比"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{OP}{OQ}=\\frac{mv_{1}}{mv_{2}}=\\frac{r_{1}}{r_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故C正确；\nD.沿径迹1运动的电子初速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{eBr_{1}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电子受的阻力"},{"type":"math","value":"f=kv"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-kv\\Delta t=0-m\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"\n求和可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum kv\\Delta t=\\sum m\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"ks=mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n总路程为"},{"type":"math","value":"s=\\frac{eB}{k}r_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，D错误。\n故选BC。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q14","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5e8d755741410880904ae346ebc12f85903924852ba1abfa7606082ebba6c662","body":[{"type":"text","value":"“在探究平抛运动实验中”\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4d2b8024843d82fe8cb6d6b926dc97b8d546e7ed10aa1ce272734a3aa7b0371c.png","width":3899,"height":1465,"width_mm":146.58,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)为探究水平方向分运动特点，应选用图1中的（填空）（选填“甲”或“乙”）装置\n(2)采用图2所示装置进行实验。将一张白纸和复写纸固定在装置的背板上，钢球落到倾斜的挡板后挤压复写纸，在白纸上留下印迹。下列说法正确的是（填空）。\nA．调节装置使其背板竖直\nB．调节斜槽使其末端切线水平\nC．以斜槽的末端在白纸上的投影点为坐标原点\nD．钢球在斜槽静止释放的高度应等间距下降\n(3)如图3所示，将实验中记录的印迹用平滑曲线连接，其中抛出点为坐标原点，A点（11.0cm，15.8cm）是记录的印迹，B点（11.8cm，19.6cm）是曲线上的一个点，为得到小球的水平速度，应取（填空）（选填“A”或“B”）点进行计算，可得水平速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）m/s。（g取"},{"type":"math","value":"9.8m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所得结果保留两位有效数字）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cae8fb6311b116e4e8c729f351d1d4fd1ce641608ed0a83f1779e6fe5c4a8a9b.png","width":1408,"height":2012,"width_mm":51.86,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q14-row2"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)乙\n(2)AB\n(3)     B     0.59\n【详解】（1）为研究水平方向分运动特点，需要将平抛运动与匀速直线运动进行对比。故应该选装置乙。\n（2）A．调节装置使其背板竖直，才能保证小球落在背板上的痕迹准确反映平抛轨迹，A正确。\nB．调节斜槽末端切线水平，才能保证小球抛出时初速度水平，B正确。\nC．坐标原点应选小球在斜槽末端时球心的位置，不是斜槽末端的投影点，C错误。\nD．每次释放小球的高度应相同，保证初速度一致，不需要等间距下降，D错误。\n故选AB。\n（3）由图可知因为B点更接近曲线轨迹上，所以为得到小球的水平速度应该选B点进行计算；\n从原点到B点，小球竖直方向上做自由落体运动，时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\sqrt{\\frac{2y_{B}}{g}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\times 0.196}{9.8}}=0.2s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{x_{B}}{t}=\\frac{0.118}{0.2}=0.59m/s"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q15","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"实验题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ea1cba37b43366908403516e5a638f09632c2635694a21e7d7eb7352892b2436","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在“探究变压器原、副线圈电压与匝数的关系”实验中：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ac3c3ed6762369d722c501fbc1e0f41998f2a83a5aaddf892972919f87b6319c.png","width":4561,"height":1704,"width_mm":125.41,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)小明先用多用电表测量图1变压器的“0”、“1400”接线柱间的电阻。选择开关位置如图2，经规范操作，指针位置如图3，测得阻值为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n(2)用匝数"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{1}=200"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{2}=400"},{"type":"text","value":"的两线圈进行实验，分别测得两端电压为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，记录于下表。下列说法正确的是（填空）（多选）；"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"/V"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1.02"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.20"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3.24"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.28"}],[{"type":"text","value":"5.36"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"/V"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.12"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.52"}],[{"type":"text","value":"6.64"}],[{"type":"text","value":"8.78"}],[{"type":"text","value":"11.02"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\nA．与"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"对应的是副线圈  B．与"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"对应的是副线圈\nC．实验中采用低压直流电源  D．多用电表选择开关应调至交流电压挡\n(3)小明将两个线圈按图4方式上下叠放。下层线圈输入电压信号如图5所示，上层线圈与示波器相连，则示波器上显示的波形为（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/483ce8c418e21611448fd31ccbb08af7d4d1b1e073b155a44b055a5a634746d5.png","width":3067,"height":1097,"width_mm":81.49,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA．"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/31065ea241b4a349059ee24196aed016994abd55489a9c23621c40c5082cc435.png","width":1035,"height":580,"width_mm":43.92,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"  B．"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/400fdf3cc1ef178b62e500756e4bb0ade752215a113832ae6f7d064a1316b6fe.png","width":1035,"height":580,"width_mm":45.51,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"  C．"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/03987c3df2c84ef2d3786921a6dcce5068b43c1cb7a828984f0f509219b41714.png","width":1035,"height":580,"width_mm":46.83,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q15-row5"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)34/34.0\n(2)AD\n(3)C\n【详解】（1）从图2可知，多用电表选择开关置于电阻×10挡位，图3中指针指向3.4，所以测得阻值为R=3.4×10=34Ω。\n（2）AB．根据变压器电压与匝数的关系"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_{1}}{U_{2}}=\\frac{n_{1}}{n_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，匝数多的线圈电压高；因为变压器由漏磁等损失，又因为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}>2U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"对应副线圈，故A正确，B错误。\nC．变压器的工作原理是电磁感应，需要交流电源，不能用直流电源，C错误。\nD．变压器输出的是交流电，测量其电压时，多用电表选择开关应调至交流电压挡，D正确。\n故选AD。\n（3）由题意可知下层线圈输入的是锯齿波电压，它的变化率（斜率）在每个周期内是恒定的；根据电磁感应原理可知上层线圈的感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E=n\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"，与磁通量的变化率成正比，也就是与输入电压的变化率成正比；输入电压的斜率恒定，所以感应电动势的大小也恒定，对应的波形是方波。故选C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q16","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"实验题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a01f65395bf720f14a1d2b66244e3987b5bee87c31fdc0b755736026396aa6dd","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在“油膜法估测油酸分子的大小”实验中\n(1)以下说法正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/766b77de39f47f7e6cd79e198489a76a2a14537391f676e78e0236ea7231151f.png","width":814,"height":729,"width_mm":52.12,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA．图示油膜形状是由于撒粉太少引起的\nB．按图示油膜面积进行计算，测得油酸分子直径偏大\nC．油酸酒精溶液放置长时间后使用，测得油酸分子直径偏大\n(2)测得一滴油酸酒精溶液所含纯油酸的体积为V，根据画有油膜轮廓的玻璃板上的坐标方格，数出轮廓范围内正方形的个数，整格的为"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"个，多于半格不足整格的数量为"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"个，已知每格的面积为S，则油酸分子的直径为（填空）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)B\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V}{\\left( N_{1}+N_{2} \\right)S}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）A．撒粉太少会导致油膜扩散时没有足够阻力，可能扩散得过大甚至溢出，或者边界模糊不清；而图中油膜呈现“尖刺”、“星芒”状，通常是撒粉太多或不均匀，导致油膜在局部被阻挡，无法均匀铺展，从而形成这种不规则形状，故A错误；\nB．按图示油膜面积计算时，测量的面积比实际油膜的面积会更小，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{V}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知测得油酸分子直径偏大，故B正确；\nC．油酸酒精溶液放置长时间后使用，因为酒精的挥发，在溶液中的油酸浓度会偏大，油酸的体积会偏大，但实际计算时仍按原来的浓度计算，则计算所用的油酸体积偏小，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{V}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知测得油酸分子直径偏小，故C错误。\n故选B。\n（2）多于半格不足整格的按整格计算，故总的格子数为"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{1}+N_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则总面积为"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{\\text{总}}=S\\left( N_{1}+N_{2} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则油酸分子直径为"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{V}{S_{\\text{总}}}=\\frac{V}{\\left( N_{1}+N_{2} \\right)S}"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q17","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4683841681bcebcebcd9e765e9aa73ad60cf47fee97835aa67e6904c2da711c1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，导热良好的瓶内，用一质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、横截面积为S的活塞封闭一定质量的理想气体，活塞能无摩擦滑动，在活塞上方有质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的液体。初始时，瓶内气体处于状态 A，体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"。将一根质量不计的细管插入液体，液体在细管中上升到一定高度后保持静止，随后通过细管缓慢吸走全部液体，此时瓶内气体处于状态B。环境温度保持不变，从状态A到状态 B 过程中，气体吸收热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=2.05J"},{"type":"text","value":"。已知"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=0.4kg"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=2kg"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"S=40cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{A}=400cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，大气压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=0.99\\times 10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"，g=10 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。 \n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fa72c749d5e532bd8f264bcf665d102e45c711f8a2a86f893c0e42933ef64ac0.png","width":800,"height":965,"width_mm":37.57,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)图中液体（填空）（选填“浸润”或“不浸润”）管壁，若细管仅内径变小，与原细管相比，管内液面将（填空）（选填“升高”、“不变”或“降低”）；\n(2)求气体在状态B时的体积"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(3)求气体从状态A到状态B过程中对外做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{AB}"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)     浸润     升高\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"420\\text{ cm}^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)2.05J\n【详解】（1）图中管中液面上升且液面呈现凹状，则液体浸润管壁，若细管仅内径变小，与原细管相比，毛细现象更加明显，管内液面升高。\n（2）初态对活塞以及上面的液体分析可知气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=p_{0}+\\frac{(m_{1}+m_{2})g}{S}=1.05\\times 10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"\n末态吸走液体后气体的压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=p_{0}+\\frac{m_{1}g}{S}=1.00\\times 10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据玻意耳定律可知"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}V_{A}=p_{2}V_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得气体在状态B时的体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{B}=\\frac{p_{1}V_{A}}{p_{2}}=\\frac{1.05\\times 10^{5}\\times 400}{1.00\\times 10^{5}}cm^{3}=420cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）气体从状态A到状态B过程中气体温度不变，则根据热力学第一定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=0"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-Q=-2.05J"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即气体对外做的功2.05J。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q18","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1a4c004e3591b851a05ca1fff0f69c4a8af81a9cf3f9a68afaea17db2460ad8d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"测量局域磁场，科学家基于电阻应变片开发出一种磁场检测芯片，其简化结构如图1所示。长度均为l、通有恒定电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（方向相反）的两刚性金属杆ab、cd，与具有良 好弹性的绝缘悬梁OA、OD构成“H”形支架，对称固定于底座O处。在悬梁上、下表面对称安装四个相同的电阻应变片（各自引出两导线），其阻值分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，将它们 按图2方式与电动势为E的电源（不计内阻）相连。未加磁场时，支架处于水平平衡状态， 此时"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"R_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，测得e、f两端的电势差为0。现施加待测磁场，其方向水平向右、且垂直于金属杆，则金属杆ab、cd受安培力作用，使悬梁OA、OD产生形变，四个应变片的阻值发生相应变化，其变化量的绝对值均为ΔR，此时测得e、f两端的电势差为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ef}"},{"type":"text","value":"，从而得到待测磁场磁感应强度B的大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b3e6df41a35ff6ef129b561df4d8fee798a367716d8d2ce029ac9f01a98ebb88.png","width":2055,"height":700,"width_mm":125.68,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)判断金属杆ab和cd所受安培力的方向； \n(2)写出上述四个电阻的阻值（用"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"和ΔR表示）；\n(3)已知电阻变化量和所受的安培力成正比关系，且比例系数为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"，求"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ef}"},{"type":"text","value":"与B之间的关系。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)ab竖直向下，cd竖直向上\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=R_{0}+\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=R_{0}-\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}=R_{0}-\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{4}=R_{0}+\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{R_{0}U_{ef}}{\\alpha EI_{0}l}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）根据左手定则可知ab所受安培力方向竖直向下；cd所受安培力方向竖直向上。\n（2）由题意可知ab向上弯曲，使"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"被拉伸（阻值增大）、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"被压缩（阻值减小），故"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=R_{0}+\\Delta R, R_{3}=R_{0}-\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"\ncd向下弯曲，使"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"被压缩（阻值减小）、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"被拉伸（阻值增大），故"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=R_{0}-\\Delta R, R_{4}=R_{0}+\\Delta R"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）由图可知"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"串联，"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"串联，两条支路并联。\n上支路总电阻为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\text{上}}=R_{1}+R_{2}=\\left( R_{0}+\\Delta R \\right)+\\left( R_{0}-\\Delta R \\right)=2R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{上}}=\\frac{E}{2R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nf点电势"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi _{f}=I_{\\text{上}}R_{2}=\\frac{E\\left( R_{0}-\\Delta R \\right)}{2R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n下支路总电阻为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\text{下}}=R_{3}+R_{4}=\\left( R_{0}-\\Delta R \\right)+\\left( R_{0}+\\Delta R \\right)=2R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{下}}=\\frac{E}{2R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\ne点电势"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi _{e}=I_{\\text{下}}R_{4}=\\frac{E\\left( R_{0}+\\Delta R \\right)}{2R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\ne、f两点间的电势差绝对值"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ef}=\\varphi _{e}-\\varphi _{f}=\\frac{E\\Delta R}{R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n安培力与ΔR的关系："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta R=\\alpha F"},{"type":"text","value":"，而"},{"type":"math","value":"F=BI_{0}l"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta R=\\alpha BI_{0}l"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{R_{0}U_{ef}}{\\alpha EI_{0}l}"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q19","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2002d8dbae141b97ae5f1def7b1af6e4950a64cf799ee8393004803eb2d98340","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示。一宽度为d的光滑长方形平板MNQP，长边MN、PQ分别平滑连接半径均为r的光滑圆弧面，形成“U”形槽，将其整体固定在水平地面上。现有质量为m的物块a，从圆弧面上相对平板竖直高度为h的A点静止下滑(h<< r)，途经圆弧面上最低点B，平板上有一质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}m"},{"type":"text","value":"的物块b与MN成45°角从O点滑入圆弧面，第一次到达最高点时恰好与同时到达最高点的物块a发生弹性碰撞。两物块均为质点。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bca1bf1f1207d7c704acebcb7c666ebdedab2cf0793c97da559ddbd87ce9b056.png","width":1787,"height":1091,"width_mm":65.35,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)求物块a第一次经过B点时速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"和所受支持力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(2)从A到B的过程：物块a相对于B点位移为x，求其所受回复力F与x的关系式；\n(3)求物块b的初速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"以及碰撞后瞬间物块a的速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(4)若h=0.032m，r=10m，d=0.4m，要使物块a从NQ之间滑离，求BQ间距L的范围。（不计额外阻力时，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=m\\left( g+\\frac{2gh}{r} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向竖直向上\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"F=-\\frac{m_{A}g}{r}x"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{\\frac{gh}{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(4)见解析\n【详解】（1）对a物块下滑过程中根据动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n在B点根据牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-mg=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=m\\left( g+\\frac{2gh}{r} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向竖直向上；\n（2）如图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c21979e8ee715714c6ee207c11d7e27904cb7674dbffd479ec1daaae9a399998.png","width":360,"height":1035,"width_mm":14.29},{"type":"text","value":"\n由于h<<r，滑块a所受回复力F，则"},{"type":"math","value":"F=-mgsin\\theta =-\\frac{mg}{r}x"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知滑块受到的回复力F与x成正比，方向与x相反，因此滑块a从释放到第一次到达最低点的运动是简谐运动。\n（3）滑块b在圆弧形斜面上垂直槽轴线方向的运动性质与a相同，平行槽轴线方向做匀速度直线运动。设滑块b的速度沿槽轴线和垂直槽轴线分速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{bx}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{by}"},{"type":"text","value":"，如图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/45f883b7e028c538c47fb53336119ae254b1c3e2a367ba3ab8160413eecd0945.png","width":1227,"height":1573,"width_mm":43.92},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{bx}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0时，滑块b第一次滑到最高点，由题意可知滑块b到达的最高点高度与滑块a的开始下滑的高度相等。此时速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{by}"},{"type":"text","value":"，经历的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{1}{4}T=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 2\\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{r}{g}}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{r}{g}}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n又因与滑块a最高点相同，由题意可知"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{bx}=v_{by}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_{b}=v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{b}=\\sqrt{2}v_{0}=2\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为滑块a、b在最高点发生碰撞，设碰后滑块b的速度为v'"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{by}"},{"type":"text","value":"。由动量守恒和机械能守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{b}v_{by}=m_{b}v'_{by}+m_{a}v_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}m_{b}v_{by}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{b}v'{}_{by}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}m_{a}v_{a}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v'_{by}=-\\sqrt{\\frac{gh}{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}=\\sqrt{\\frac{gh}{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）碰后滑块a在平行于槽轴线方向的速度始终为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，从MN边界射出的最基本的几种临界情况如图1、2、3、4所示。考虑周期性，则L有多种情况\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/528dfc3d2f8d0c15ae086b90b405e06f04b378797745adaeaf533c0c870ff719.png","width":4895,"height":1367,"width_mm":146.58},{"type":"text","value":"\n由题给数据可得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v'_{by}=-0.4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}=0.4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n滑块a每一次在圆弧型斜面上滑或下滑的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n滑块a每一次滑过水平面的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=\\frac{d}{v_{0}}=0.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n又由于滑块a从任一点出发回到该点同高度位置时的时间相等，设时间为T，则T=4"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"+2"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=(2π+1) s\n滑块a由碰后到从MN之间飞出的时间t满足"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{L}{v_{a}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，L=0.4t\n所以由图1、2可知"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}<t<t_{1}+t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}+T<t<t_{1}+t_{2}+T"},{"type":"text","value":"，……\n由图3、4可知"},{"type":"math","value":"3t_{1}+t_{2}<t<3t_{1}+2t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}+\\frac{T}{2}<t<t_{1}+t_{2}+\\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"或者"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}+\\frac{T}{2}+T<t<t_{1}+t_{2}+\\frac{T}{2}+T"},{"type":"text","value":"，……\n综上分析可知t应满足"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}+n\\frac{T}{2}<t<t_{1}+t_{2}+n\\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则滑块a能从MN之间飞出时L的范围为"},{"type":"math","value":"[0.2\\pi +n(0.4\\pi +0.2)]m<L<[0.2\\pi +0.2+n(0.4\\pi +0.2)]m"},{"type":"text","value":"，（n=0，1，2，3，4……）"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601-q20","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202601","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202601-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a7e6ec514edeae597cb9e31a3545e2fc18ade2f9e8965c0aa7740d503a67f5cf","body":[{"type":"text","value":"俄歇电子能谱（AES）广泛应用于材料表面成分分析。如图1所示，一束高能电子入射到样品表面，将某原子内层（如K层）的一个电子击出，形成一个空穴。随后，较外层（如L层）的一个电子跃迁至该空穴，并释放出能量，该能量可能以X光子的形式射出，也可能立即将另一核外电子（如L层或M层的电子）电离而逸出样品表面，该电子称为俄歇电子；现用电子动能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{e}=15.0keV"},{"type":"text","value":"的电子束轰击某样品表面，成功激发KLM俄歇过程（即初始空穴为K层、跃迁电子来自L层、逸出电子来自M层）和KLL俄歇过程（逸出电子来自L层）。已知该原子K层的电离能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{K}\\approx 10.0keV"},{"type":"text","value":"L层的电离能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{L}=1.0keV"},{"type":"text","value":"已知电子的电荷量"},{"type":"math","value":"e=1.60\\times 10^{-19}C"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{e}=9.1\\times 10^{-31}kg"},{"type":"text","value":"，光速"},{"type":"math","value":"c=3\\times 10^{8}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，普朗克常量"},{"type":"math","value":"h=6.63\\times 10^{-34}J\\cdot s"},{"type":"text","value":"。（计算结果保留一位有效数字）请回答：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5fdf8f8380a063a9bbcedadb621b1067bc00eb8a7736b3637aa6ce41a707c036.png","width":2983,"height":1240,"width_mm":102.13,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202601-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)入射电子的德布罗意波长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n(2)求射出的X光子的波长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{X}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(3)甲同学利用带电粒子在磁场中的运动规律，设计了如图2所示的测量俄歇电子动能的方案；俄歇电子从原点O垂直y轴和磁场方向进入匀强磁场，则"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=10.0cm和"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=10.5cm处被探测到，通过测得的俄歇电子的动能，求原子M层的电离能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{M}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(4)乙同学认为用带电粒子在电场中的运动规律，测出俄歇电子的动能，请你帮乙同学设计一个方案，列出所需要测量的物理量，并给出计算俄歇电子动能的表达式。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{e}=1\\times 10^{-11}m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{X}=1\\times 10^{-10}m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{M}\\approx 0.2keV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(4)见解析\n【详解】（1）由德布罗意公式"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{e}=\\frac{h}{p}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{e}=\\frac{p^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{e}=\\frac{h}{\\sqrt{2m_{e}E_{e}}}=1\\times 10^{-11}m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）因"},{"type":"math","value":"K\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"线是由电子从L层跃迁到K层时释放的光子，则光子的能量为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{M}=E_{K}-E_{L}=9keV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则由"},{"type":"math","value":"E=h\\nu =\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{X}=\\frac{hc}{E_{M}}=1\\times 10^{-10}m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）电子在磁场中做圆周运动，洛伦兹力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"evB=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n俄歇电子的动能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=\\frac{e^{2}B^{2}R^{2}}{2m}=\\frac{e^{2}B^{2}}{8m}d^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（d表示直径）\n设KLL俄歇电子的动能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{KLL}"},{"type":"text","value":"；KLM俄歇电子的动能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{KLM}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{E_{KLL}}{E_{KLM}}=\\frac{d_{1}^{2}}{d_{2}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nKLL俄歇电子：K层空穴由L层电子填充，释放的能量为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{L}"},{"type":"text","value":"，并传递给L层另一个电子使其逸出，又消耗"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{L}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则KLL俄歇电子的动能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{KLL}=(E_{K}-E_{L})-E_{L}=8.0keV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n同理可得，KLM俄歇电子的动能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{KLM}=(E_{K}-E_{L})-E_{M}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{M}=0.18keV\\approx 0.2keV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）让待测电子束以水平初速度射入两块平行金属板之间，金属板长为L，板间距为d，两板之间加恒定的电压U，形成匀强电场，在离开金属板右侧距离"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"处垂直电子入射方向放置一荧光屏，如图所示\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5751c1f9375d1affca73fcd70440d29047587dee3eba4cb6700ccd9c2e7892b9.png","width":1865,"height":798,"width_mm":74.35},{"type":"text","value":"\n需要测量的物理量：金属板长度L，板间电压U，板间距d以及"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子飞出电场后打到荧光屏时垂直电子入射方向的侧移量y；\n计算方法：电子在水平方向做匀速直线运动，则"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{L}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电子在竖直方向做初速度为零的匀加速直线运动，则加速度"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{eU}{dm_{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n侧移量满足"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}at^{2}}{y}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}L}{\\frac{1}{2}L+L_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n俄歇电子动能表达式"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=\\frac{eUL^{2}(L+2L_{1})}{4dyL}"}]}}]}
